<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">DELIVERY CONFIRMATION</view
  ><view class="title">确认交付，再出发</view
  ><view wx:if="{{order}}" class="card"
    ><view class="order-no">{{order.orderNo}}</view
    ><view class="product-name">{{order.label}} × {{order.orderQty}}</view
    ><view class="detail"
      >{{order.addressSnapshot.contactName}} ·
      {{order.addressSnapshot.address}}</view
    ></view
  ><view class="footer-note"
    >请按实际情况登记。本页按预约数量交付，差额交付请在现有员工端办理。</view
  ><text class="form-label">收回空桶 / 空袋数量</text
  ><view class="row">
  <button class="secondary-btn small-btn" data-delta="-1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="减少回收数量">−</button>
  <input
    type="number"
    value="{{emptyInM}}"
    data-field="emptyInM"
    bindinput="input"
    maxlength="4"
  />
  <button class="secondary-btn small-btn" data-delta="1" bindtap="quantity" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="增加回收数量">+</button>
  </view><block wx:if="{{order.fulfillMode === 'PICKUP'}}"
    ><text class="form-label">会员出示的自提码</text
    ><input
      type="number"
      value="{{pickupCode}}"
      data-field="pickupCode"
      bindinput="input"
      maxlength="12"
      placeholder="请输入会员自提码" /></block
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view
  ><button
    class="primary"
    bindtap="submit"
    disabled="{{busy || !order}}"
    loading="{{busy}}"
  >
    确认交付 {{order.orderQty}} 份
  </button></view
>
